findings.suggestion:
先校验 Content-Length 并拒绝超限请求，再分块读取并累计字节数：
MAX_UPLOAD = 10 * 1024 * 1024
def read_upload(stream, limit=MAX_UPLOAD):
    buf, total = bytearray(), 0
    while True:
        chunk = stream.read(64 * 1024)
        if not chunk:
            break
        total += len(chunk)
        if total > limit:
            raise ValueError("upload too large")
        buf += chunk
    return bytes(buf)

